Type: Package
Package: fundr
Title: Fundraising Analytics Helpers
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Matt", "Farrow", , "matt@mattfarrow.co", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph")),
    person("Claude", "(Anthropic AI)", role = "ctb",
           comment = "AI programming assistant")
  )
Description: Provides utility functions for fundraising and advancement
    analytics workflows. Includes fiscal year calculations, donor status
    classification, phone and ZIP code normalization, and currency formatting.
    Core functions have zero dependencies; optional features integrate with
    'ggplot2' for visualization themes and scales.
